  - messages:
    - Sometimes I get this feeling, and I need to, um....
    - "...Well, I need to find a nice \nsecluded place away from everyone.\n"
    - '...where I can... um....

      I''ll, uh... explain when you''re older.'
    - (Oh God, why am I talking to her about this?)
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 3d6b7484767d27b46996d709c268f743, type: 3}
